*> vybe-test: cobol/conditions/test_condition_class_numeric
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_conditions.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TXT1 PIC X(3) VALUE "123".
01 WS-TXT2 PIC X(3) VALUE "ABC".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF WS-TXT1 IS NUMERIC
        DISPLAY "TXT1-NUM"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "TXT1-NUM" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "TXT1-NUM"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [TXT1-NUM] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    IF WS-TXT2 IS NOT NUMERIC
        DISPLAY "TXT2-NOT-NUM"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "TXT2-NOT-NUM" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "TXT2-NOT-NUM"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [TXT2-NOT-NUM] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

